here in the north i was sent to make
sure the fiends hadn't dug them out

229
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:16,897
and is the cave north of here safe
or have they dug through it i spent

230
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:21,997
all day up there keeping a vigilant
eye upon it in all that time i did not

231
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:27,077
spot any orcs or goblins i'm happy to
report the cave is still filled with

232
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:33,400
debris then as i made my way back to
the capital takiguri began behaving

