234
00:19:35,233 --> 00:19:38,637
I allowed him free rein, and
this is where he chose to land.

235
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,540
Your new home, and

236
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:46,237
now that we've been reunited at last,
you will forgive me for speaking my mind.

237
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:48,960
Lady Alice, please return to the Order.

238
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:52,460
We need your sword now,
more than ever, more than an

239
00:19:57,560 --> 00:19:58,390
